# Kept out of the build context.
#
# The Dockerfile only copies app/ and models/, so none of this was ever in the
# image - but everything here is uploaded to the daemon before the first
# instruction runs, and .venv alone is 482MB. A build that should take seconds
# spent most of them shipping a virtualenv that the image then rebuilds from
# requirements.txt anyway.
.venv
venv
env
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache

# Training inputs and working documents. The service loads a serialized model
# from models/; it never reads the raw sessions or the extracted windows, and
# dev_tools is where those are turned into one.
data
dev_tools
archive
tests

.git
.gitignore
*.log
